
# Project 07 - Container Health Monitoring and Secure Deployment

Campus IT Asset Inventory System

## Project Overview

This project explores container health monitoring, service reliability and secure infrastructure deployment using Docker Compose, Apache HTTPD and PostgreSQL.

The project extends previous container security exercises by introducing database health checks, health-based service dependencies and operational availability monitoring.

## Technical Objectives

- Deploy a multi-container infrastructure environment.
- Configure CPU and memory restrictions.
- Implement frontend and backend network segmentation.
- Restrict direct database exposure.
- Configure persistent database storage.
- Apply least-privilege security controls.
- Implement database health checks.
- Configure health-based startup dependencies.
- Perform database backup and restoration.

